🛠️ Lab Setup – Week 6
This folder contains the setup and configuration details for the Week 6 web security testing environment. 
It includes the DVWA deployment using Docker, VirtualBox network configuration, and verification of connectivity between Kali Linux and Ubuntu. 🔐🌐 
These steps established the secure local lab environment for SQL Injection, XSS, Burp Suite, and OWASP ZAP testing. 🚀
